        <obo:IAO_0000112>A person has a behaviour disposition to realise consumption behaviour</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000114>Published</obo:IAO_0000114>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A &lt;bodily disposition&gt; that is realised as some behaviour.</obo:IAO_0000115>
