        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;A more striking example of this effect is seen in the extrusion of the proboscis in the Nemertine worms where a small contraction of the circular musculature leads to the extrusion of a proboscis several times the length of the animal...&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1242/jeb.27.3.264</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
