        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Within the basic grouping into MPF and BCF propulsion, further types of swimming... can be identified for each group... These... should be thought of as pronounced points within a continuum, rather than discrete sets. Fish may exhibit more than one... either at the same time or at different speeds.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
