        <owl:annotatedTarget>Pedestrian mode that uses six appendages.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:contributor>https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4277-2151</dc:contributor>
        <rdfs:comment>Inferred.</rdfs:comment>
