        <oboInOwl:hasDefinition>Walk gait that is lateral-sequence, diagonal-couplet, and vaulting.

The animal spends most of its time supported on diagonal pairs of limbs.</oboInOwl:hasDefinition>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>LSDC walk</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>lateral sequence diagonal couplet walk</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">LSDC-walk gait</rdfs:label>
        <skos:scopeNote>&quot;This is the most common pattern for slow moving mammals.&quot;</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:Class>
