        <oboInOwl:hasDefinition>Trot gait that realizes a hexapedal pattern.</oboInOwl:hasDefinition>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>alternating tripod running gait</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">alternating-tripod-trot gait</rdfs:label>
        <skos:example>&quot;The six-legged cockroach B. discoidalis used an alternating tripod gait similar to other symmetrical gaits... Even though an aerial phase is absent, this gait has been characterized as a running or bouncing gait.&quot;</skos:example>
