        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Apomorphic characters were the derived mouth-gaping behavior of A. piscivorous and the specialized tail coil and ventral tail exposure of C. pricei.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>https://search.proquest.com/openview/163eedf011944cd2321739b51d33470d/1?pq-origsite=gscholar&amp;cbl=18750&amp;diss=y</dc:source>
