        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Nocomis leptocephalus...
As the female moved forward over the upstream rim of the pit, she gaped and abruptly tossed her head vertically into the water column.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1674/0003-0031(2000)144[0187:SBITBC]2.0.CO;2</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
