        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Like other animals, C. elegans exhibit long-lasting behavioral states in which they display different movement patterns. By switching between different locomotion states, animals can alter how they explore their environment, for example searching for food locally vs. more globally...

In each locomotion state, C. elegans animals express a characteristic set of locomotor parameters over a long-lasting, stable time period.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1534/genetics.120.303539</dc:source>
