        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>walking pace</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>amble gait</rdfs:label>
        <skos:scopeNote>&quot;Duty factors in this pattern may be &lt;0.5 and still lack an aerial phase in quadrupeds (amble) if the duty factors of the forelimbs and hindlimbs differ significantly.&quot;</skos:scopeNote>
