        <skos:example>&quot;This gait is typified by the trotting of the horse.&quot;</skos:example>
        <skos:scopeNote>&quot;Reptiles and amphibians are historically thought to use “walking trots” at slow speeds (trots with a duty factor &gt;0.5) and “running trots” (trots with a duty factor &lt;0.5) at higher speeds.&quot;</skos:scopeNote>
