The at first the larvae only crawl along the bottom, ascending in this way the slopes of the pit, but after some hours they are able to swim freely at a llittle distance above the bottom.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1163/156853981X00220</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
