        <oboInOwl:hasDefinition>Perception that responds to heat and cold.</oboInOwl:hasDefinition>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>temperature-evoked behavior</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>thermosensory sensory experience</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
