        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;In the case of resource defense, conspecifics manifest differences in fighting ability, and, thus, the energy invested by the owner specimens to keep all the competitors at bay from the resource will not be equally distributed (i.e., either the degree of agonistic interactions with each competitor or the duration of the contests).&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
