        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>https://www.science.nus.edu.sg/wp-content/uploads/sites/11/2024/05/s22rbz145-157.pdf</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <skos:scopeNote>&quot;Such spatial constraints may also occur on J. juncea colonies, where gobies are often seen lined up in single file when two or more individuals share the same whip coral.&quot;</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:Axiom>
