        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2024-11-18T17:00:56.430863Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
        <oboInOwl:hasDefinition>Mothering that involves viviparity.

In mammals this is approximately the time from conceptional estrus until parturition.</oboInOwl:hasDefinition>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">gestation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>pregnancy</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>gravid</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">gestation mothering</rdfs:label>
        <skos:example>&quot;Female pitvipers frequently aggregate during gestation, with at least one species (Crotalus horridus) forming aggregations consisting of relatives, as pitvipers are capable of kin recognition.&quot;</skos:example>
    </owl:Class>
