        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>doi:10.5962/p.203769</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <skos:scopeNote>&quot;This produces the appearance of a progression more or less snake or eel-like, although in general the powerful sweeps of the strong tail characterize the progression as fish-like.”&quot;</skos:scopeNote>
