        <dc:source>doi:10.1242/jeb.021360</dc:source>
        <skos:scopeNote>&quot;...abduction of the fin rays by the supracarinalis (SC) and infracarinalis
(IC) to increase the tail surface area...&quot;</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
