        <owl:annotatedTarget>Dissociation in which multiple animals move away from each other.

They may reaggregate later.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:contributor>https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4277-2151</dc:contributor>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1089/zeb.2012.0861</dc:source>
