        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Fright in Badis badis finds expression in three more or less conflicting kinds of behavior... The most extrewe type of Avoiding is panicky flight ; the behavior has negative valence since the only taxis is away from the stimulus, if the stimulus is located.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
