        <oboInOwl:created_by>Ditch Townsend</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2025-02-10T07:42:38.147107Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
        <oboInOwl:hasDefinition>Avoidance that is a submissive movement away from a dominant agonist.</oboInOwl:hasDefinition>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>retiring</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">retreat</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>withdrawing</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">retreat avoidance</rdfs:label>
        <skos:closeMatch>NBO:0000127</skos:closeMatch>
        <skos:example>&quot;In response to the gorilla’s behaviour, an intruder, although discouraged from approaching, may decide not to retreat but to remain in its location.&quot;</skos:example>
        <skos:example>&quot;Nocomis leptocephalus...
Once released, the female continued to rise vertically into the water column, then quickly rolled upright and... retreated downstream...&quot;</skos:example>
    </owl:Class>
