        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;After mating, T. albomaculosus... males stayed there to care for the eggs... The frequencies of parental care behaviors (in bouts per 10 min) were... 0.66 (sucking and spitting)...&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
