        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;&quot;Neck-dipping&quot; is the main pre-copulatory movement of both male and female... In Anser... the birds may also up-end as in feeding or in bringing up food for the young;&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1163/156853965x00138</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
