        <owl:annotatedTarget>Hunt that separates food from surrounding inorganic material and other nonfood particles at the substrate interface.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>ISBN:9780226315737</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <skos:scopeNote>&quot;We exclude from consideration those animals that &quot;bottom feed&quot; by separating food from surrounding inorganic material and other nonfood particles at the sediment-water interface or that &quot;deposit feed&quot; by directly consuming particulate matter on or in the bottom.&quot;</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
