        <oboInOwl:hasDefinition>Placement that results from protracting.</oboInOwl:hasDefinition>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>protracted</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>protraction</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
