        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Musth-Walk typically includes the Behaviours: Ears-Stiff, Head-High, Chin-In, Purposeful-Walk, Musth-Temporal-Gland-Secretion, Urine-Dribbling.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
