        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;The Magpie Goose performs Wing-shaking as part of a display. The male and female of a pair walk around each other calling, erecting the feathers on the back, and repeatedly shaking the wings vigorously.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
