        <owl:annotatedTarget>Power grip which causes strain.

This may lead to deformation, breaking, or expelling.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1242/jeb.27.3.264</dc:source>
        <dc:source>https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4277-2151</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
