Ejection of seminal fluid from penis. Males begin to ejaculate at 9 years old at Mahale. Semen is often eaten by both sexes.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1537/ase.107.141</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
