        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Hemichromis bimaculatus...
The principal colour of the fish is red... females were always bright orange-red, the males more violet-red when bearing the reproductive markings... When not reproductively motivated the fishes are brownish red with a greenish hue. However, a change from deep red into bright orange-red can take place in a very short time.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1163/156853981X00220</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ACTAN_0000866"/>
