        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;T. cupido... often a male would be forced to stray to the outskirts of his comparatively large territory... Frequently, a male would spend as long as 20 minutes driving off other males while attempting to isolate a female.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
