The male remains quivering at some distance from the female, then charges on the female, which tries to evade the blow by placing herself rapidly parallel to the male.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1163/156853981X00220</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
