        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Cichlosoma meeki...
It looks as if she is going to receive a very heavy blow, but just before the male has reached the female, he brakes and only touches her gently.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1163/156853981X00220</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
