        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Pair-bonded fish exhibit several affiliative behaviors. In cichlids, pair-bonded individuals display parallel swimming, tail beating, circling, greeting, and affiliative bites.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
