...the female ‘glided’, that is, when she swam towards the displaying male using her pectoral fins with a smooth motion; the more courtship a female receives, the more likely the female will glide.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>doi:10.1007/s00265-010-0980-6</dc:source>
