        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Attendant associations are usually small and comprise a maximum of around 10 individuals. They consist of one or two nuclear individuals of one species followed by associates of one or more species.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>ISBN:9789798105975</dc:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
