        <owl:annotatedTarget>&quot;Ephemeral foraging association... formerly grouped together as nuclear-follower... Brief interactions... Associate species does not move away from its territory to continue the interaction.&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dc:source>ISBN:978-0-9808572-5-2</dc:source>
