        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000141"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A structural quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s being thicker or more closely packed together; pressed tightly together.</obo:IAO_0000115>
