        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001637"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A necessity quality inhering in a process by virtue of the bearer&apos;s being essential or indispensable.</obo:IAO_0000115>
