        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000039"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A directional quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s direction that is similar to the direction of an object to the south when it faces north.</obo:IAO_0000115>
