        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000406"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A curvature quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s being curved backward or inward.</obo:IAO_0000115>
