        <obo:IAO_0000115>Anatomical system that overlaps the nervous system and is responsible for receiving and processing sensory information.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>An early step in the evolution of neural crest, therefore, may have been the origin of a specific dorsal neural cell population contributing to sensory processing; this would predate the divergence of the amphioxus and vertebrate lineages.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>organa sensuum</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
