        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000464"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Anatomical space that is the external opening of a gill slit connecting the pharyngeal cavity to the exterior. Gill opening is usually paired and located on the lateral or ventral surfaces of the head.</obo:IAO_0000115>
